{"id":"0e8c3680a7e3","path":"/en/university/info/press/publications","lang":"en","title":"Corporate publications","description":"The main corporate publications on USI and its activities are listed below. Scientific publications of professors and researchers of the University are available at this page.","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Info","Press"],"image":null,"words":80,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/media/pubblicazioni","en":"/en/university/info/press/publications"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/originalnode/8524"},{"label":"Info","path":"/en/originalnode/14049"},{"label":"Press","path":"/en/university/info/press"},{"label":"Corporate publications","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>The main <strong>corporate publications</strong> on USI and its activities are listed below.<strong> Scientific publications</strong> of professors and researchers of the University are available <a href=\"http://search.usi.ch/en/publications\">at this page</a>. Publications on the activities of the Academy of Architecture – published by <strong>Mendrisio Academy Press</strong> – <a href=\"http://www.arc.usi.ch/en/attivita/mendrisio-academy-press\">are listed here</a>.</p> <p><strong>Corporate publications</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"/en/originalnode/140\">USI Annual Reports</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://newsletter.usi.ch/ns_published/it/97\">Newsletter <em>USI Flash</em></a></li> <li><a href=\"https://newsletter.usi.ch/archive/en\">other USI newsletters</a></li> </ul><p><strong>Past corporate publications</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"/it/originalnode/128\">Magazine <em>USI Square</em></a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/originalnode/132\">Newsletter <em>USI-Link</em></a></li> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/press/press-glimpse-future-usi.pdf\">Brochure <em>A glimpse into the future of USI</em></a></li> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/press/press-10-storie-10-anni-it.pdf\">Brochure <em>10 stories for 10 years</em></a></li> </ul>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"Institutional Communication","href":"/en/university/info/press"},{"label":"Press releases","href":"/en/university/info/press/press-releases"},{"label":"Get to know USI","href":"/en/university/info/press/get-to-know-us"},{"label":"Introduction","href":"/en/university/info/press/follow-us"},{"label":"USI on Social Media","href":"/en/university/info/press/follow-us/social-media"},{"label":"USI in the Media","href":"/en/university/info/press/follow-us/press-review"},{"label":"Stay in touch","href":"/en/university/info/press/follow-us/stay-in-touch"},{"label":"Corporate publications","href":"/en/university/info/press/publications"},{"label":"Information for the USI community","href":"/en/university/info/press/info-for-the-community"},{"label":"Institutional Communication Service","href":"/en/university/info/press/about/service"},{"label":"USI Newsroom","href":"/en/university/info/press/about/newsroom"}],"links":[{"label":"Institutional Communication Service","href":"https://search.usi.ch/en/organisational-units/155/institutional-communication-service"},{"label":"+41 58 666 47 92","href":"tel:+41586664792"},{"label":"press@usi.ch","href":"mailto:press@usi.ch"},{"label":"USI at a glance","href":"/originalnode/9"},{"label":"Images and logotype","href":"/originalnode/124"},{"label":"Presenting and promoting USI","href":"/originalnode/611"}],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/university/info/press/publications","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T17:41:24.563Z"}